the iron throne awaits the conqueror!\n\nFunction Update\n1. Hand Tracking\n2. Avatar & Voice Chat\n\n Core Features\n- 8 AI levels \n- Online mode: Friend Room; Playing with mobile or vr opponents\n- 4 scenes: Medieval Castle & Pixel-style & Space & Japanese-style room\n- Review and analysis of chess moves\n- 1000+ puzzles \n- Fight animations and sound FX\n- Both Hand tracking and Touch controllers are supported!\n\nWe will constantly optimize and update to bring you a better experience. Avatars, voice IP are on the way. Feel free to leave feedback in comments.", "short_description": "Brave chess players, unsheathe your sword and commence a medieval duel on the chessboard!\n\nFunction Update\n1. Hand Tracking\n2. Avatar & Voice Chat\n\n Core Features\n- 8 AI levels \n- Online mode: Friend Room; Playing with mobile or vr opponents\n- 4 scenes: Medieval Castle & Pixel-style & Space & Japanese-style room\n- Review and analysis of chess moves\n- 1000+ puzzles \n- Fight animations and sound FX\n- Both Hand tracking and Touch controllers are supported!"}]}, "developer_name": "Mastery VR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://masteryvrstudio.com/privacyPolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mastery VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://masteryvrstudio.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "es", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking